{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Reunion"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Memento For You"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Past tense and Past Continuous tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Past Tense & Past Continuous tense<br><br>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular. <br>Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.<br> Irregular verbs change in different ways. <br>For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did </span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask \u2026 ?</span><br><span class=\"italic\">Did is</span> the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs. <br> Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talked  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walk \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walked  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were walking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focus \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"focused \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were focusing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lead\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"led\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"   was/were leading\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"return \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"returned \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were returning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swerve \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swerved \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were swerving\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le18ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Reacting to a Story - Expressing Shock and Disbelief"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Shock is a sudden, usually unpleasant feeling."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you are shocked, you are in disbelief.  Here are some examples you can use in a conversation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was shocked to read the story. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was stunned by the news.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was completely taken aback by the way he spoke. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I was just stunned by her behavior.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">The accident came as a complete shock. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">They are all in complete shock.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br><br>Disbelief is a feeling that you do not or cannot believe or accept that something is true or real."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some examples you can use in a conversation:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I just can't believe he married my sister. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">It's unbelievable that they finished the test on time.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> I just can't imagine they were able to get to work on time.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "souvenir"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " something that is kept as a reminder of a place you visited "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I bought some souvenirs on my trip."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a blog about rooms and objects."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coincidence "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a situation in which events happen at the same time in a way that is not planned or expected "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was a coincidence that she had the same painting."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ensuite "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used to describe a bathroom that is directly connected to a bedroom "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hung one of the painting in the ensuite."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hallway"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the area between two rooms where you walk "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My miniature Greek statue is in the hallway."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "appraiser "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who gives an opinion on the condition, quality, or importance of an object "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother's friend is an appraiser."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tupperware"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "plastic containers used for storage"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother's friend dropped off some tupperware."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "collectable "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "good for a collection"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Those statues are very collectable."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "auction house "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where you buy and sell items through bidding"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother's friend works at an auction house."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob08aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and research knicknacks."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of ten knickknacks you can buy. How much do they cost?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose three knickknacks you like the most."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write three sentences about these knickknacks. Are they cheap?Expensive?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your notes aloud to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research knickknacks online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of items I find online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my list to a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob08re2img02.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le18ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Hey readers,\n<br><br>\nYou won't believe what happened.  As you know, I bought a lot of interesting items on my trip to Europe. Anyway, my mother's friend, Louise, came by my apartment to drop off some tupperware she had of my mother's.  She was looking at my new purchases when she spotted my miniature Greek statue in the hallway.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le18ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Firstly, I found out she is an appraiser for an auction house.  Secondly, while she was talking about it, she mentioned that is was incredibly collectable. I was stunned by the news.  Although she was examining a number of items, she spent most of her time admiring a painting in my ensuite.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn5le18ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "It was very similar to one she has hanging in her living room at home. What a coincidence! She recommended that I take the statue to her auction house for a full appraisal. It may be worth thousands of dollars.  I just can't believe that this is happening.\n<br><br>\nWhat do you think? Did this happen to you before?\n<br><br>\nSal xox", "id": 3, "time": "37500", "image": "engenn5le18ob08re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob08re4aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob08re4img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le18ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}]}}]}, {"id": 4, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le18ob08re2vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "Hey readers,\n<br><br>\nYou won't believe what happened.  As you know, I bought a lot of interesting items on my trip to Europe. Anyway, my mother's friend, Louise, came by my apartment to drop off some tupperware she had of my mother's.  She was looking at my new purchases when she spotted my miniature Greek statue in the hallway.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": ""}, {"text": "Firstly, I found out she is an appraiser for an auction house.  Secondly, while she was talking about it, she mentioned that is was incredibly collectable. I was stunned by the news.  Although she was examining a number of items, she spent most of her time admiring a painting in my ensuite.", "id": 2, "time": "18600", "image": ""}, {"text": "It was very similar to one she has hanging in her living room at home. What a coincidence! She recommended that I take the statue to her auction house for a full appraisal. It may be worth thousands of dollars.  I just can't believe that this is happening. What do you think? Did this  happen to you before?\n<br/><br/>\nSal<br/>\nxox", "id": 3, "time": "36000", "image": ""}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about rooms and objects in them. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can react and comment on a story."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can say what I was doing when something else happened."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Is there something you own that is very valuable? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " When did you find out it was expensive to buy?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "  Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Writing Spot: Sally writes about her big surprise."}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [4], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Sally writes about her valuable <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_1\">discovery</span>.  She i